unity at large.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Yes.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Yes.\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: So, it is an exciting thing, yes, and what is cool is, no matter what happens this morning, most of these people, if not all of the people, they`ve got to do a show tonight.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: That`s right! They are working tonight.\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Their passion is fueling their dream, I think that`s such a remarkable thing about this.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: So you, so do you, and you also have to read our first category.\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Yes, I do, so yes, but this isn`t about me. This is about some nominees --\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Yes.\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: -- for Best Performance by an Actor in a Leading Role in a musical. And they are --\par \par \uc2 (Clip from "Chess")\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Nicholas Christopher, "Chess."\par \par \uc2 (Clip from "Richard O`Brians" The Rocky Horror Show")\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Luke Evans, "Richard O`Brien`s, : The Rocky Horror Show."\par \par \uc2 (Clip from "Ragtime")\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Joshua Henry "Ragtime."\par \par \uc2 (Clip from "Two Strangers (Carry A Cake Across New York)")\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Sam Tutty, "Two Strangers (Carry A Cake Across New York)"\par \par \uc2 (Clip from "Ragtime")\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Brandon Uranowitz, "Ragtime."\par \par \uc2 I can say this without any, any, any, any hesitation. I love all of these guys.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Yes. You know them.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: This is a tough category.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: But a lot of people are saying Joshua Henry, this might be his year.\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Josh is, listen --\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: Last night --\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: He killed on the Met steps.\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Yes, I know, he was at the Met.\par \par \uc2 UZO ADUBA: Yes.\par \par \uc2 DARREN CRISS: Luke Evans, I`m an old pal with.