unday Morning."\par \par \uc2 BOB WOODWARD (Journalist and author): And he gives it to him for his personal use, and Putin says, oh, he takes him, don`t tell anyone that you did this. And Trump says, I don`t care.\par \par \uc2 NIKOLE KILLION: The Trump campaign called Woodward "an angry little man," while the former president vehemently denied the claims.\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2  (Former President of the United States): That`s wrong. That`s absolutely wrong. Look, I know Bob Woodward, no, that`s a -- that`s a false story.\par \par \uc2 NIKOLE KILLION: But in a back-to-back blitz, Harris continued to bounce on the reporting.\par \par \uc2 VICE PRESIDENT KAMALA HARRIS: Everybody was scrambling to get these kits, the tests, the COVID test kits.\par \par \uc2 HOWARD STERN (Radio talk show host): Couldn`t get them.\par \par \uc2 VICE PRESIDENT KAMALA HARRIS: Couldn`t get them. Couldn`t get them anywhere.\par \par \uc2 HOWARD STERN: Right. Right.\par \par \uc2 VICE PRESIDENT KAMALA HARRIS: And this guy who was president of the United States is sending them to Russia? To a murderous dictator for his personal use?\par \par \uc2 (End VT)\par \par \uc2 NIKOLE KILLION: The Kremlin denied the Woodward report. While Trump is here in Pennsylvania, Harris heads to Nevada and Arizona where early voting gets underway -- Nate.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: Nikole, thank you.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FBI\uc2  has arrested an immigrant from Afghanistan on suspicion of planning an election day terror attack here in the US.\par \par \uc2 Nicole Sganga has more of the alleged plot.\par \par \uc2 Nicole, good morning.\par \par \uc2 NICOLE SGANGA: Good morning.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FBI\uc2  says an election day attack targeting large crowds in the US has now been thwarted. Agents arrested Nasir Ahmad Tawhedi Monday after officials say the 27-year-old took steps to purchase AK 47 rifles and ammunition, going so far as to sell off his family`s home to raise money.\par \par \uc2 Federal