 $1 million restoring it. The ship, which he named \uc2 Aurora\uc2  features, 85 cabins, a swimming pool, and a theater.\par \par \uc2 Wilson says, he, and a team of volunteers had about 10 areas fully restored when he reluctantly had to sell the ship last year.\par \par \uc2 Look what happened just months later, the Coast Guard found that the \uc2 Aurora\uc2  was taking on water and sinking. Officials in Stockton, California, where the ship is docked say they`re trying to figure out how to dispose it.\par \par \uc2 So the reason I want to do this story is because he, the way he talks about this ship, he named it \uc2 Aurora\uc2  because he woke up when he was sleeping on board of the ship one day to a beautiful sunrise, and he had this dream of turning it into a museum so that people could experience it. It was one of the first luxury cruise ships that was built in Germany after World War Two.\par \par \uc2 And I just think that whenever somebody dreams about something, and they put all their money and their life and their effort into and it doesn`t work out, I don`t know, something hits me in my soul about that.\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: Yes.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: That`s right. Because you know what it means to them.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Yes.\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: Yes, yes.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: So --\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: It does support my old adage about boat purchases. The two best days of boat ownership are the day you bought it and the day you sold it.\par \par \uc2 Ahead, our exclusive conversation with "Transformers One" star, Scarlett Johansson.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: I don`t know --\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: He always looks on the bright side.\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: But first a check of your local weather.\par \par \uc2 (LOCAL WEATHER)\par \par \uc2 (ANNOUNCEMENTS)\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: We are so excited to have Scarlett Johansson talking to us exclusively about starring in the action-packed new film, "Transformers One." And when I say excited, Vlad has been jumping up and down like a little boy all morning, that`s how excited he is.\par \par \uc2 The Oscar nominated actor plays Elita-1, thank you very much.\par \par \uc2 In this clip, she gives young Optimus Prime a pep talk on their journey to find the Matrix of Leadership, which was believed to be the key to saving their world.\par \par \uc2 (Clip from "Transformers One"/Paramount Pictures)\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: That was one of my favorite scenes.\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: That`s a great scene.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: "First time giving a pep talk."\par \par \uc2 "Transformers One" is part of the Paramount family, just like us and only on CBS MORNINGS, we love when this happens. I`m going to say it twice, only on CBS MORNINGS, Scarlett Johansson joins us from London.\par \par \uc2 Hello, Scarlett Johansson.\par \par \uc2 SCARLETT JOHANSSON ("Transformer One" actor): Hello.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: We are so glad you`re here.\par \par \uc2 SCARLETT JOHANSSON: Hi. How are you?\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: We are so good, Scarlett. You have some of the best lines, like, "Thanks for being an idiot," she says at one point, because she is really the one who`s leading the charge here.\par \par \uc2 But this is what I heard that the director reached out to you for the job of Elita-1 because he said he only heard your voice in this role.\par \par \uc2 Number one, you`ve got a great voice. What did that mean to you hearing that from the director?\par \par \uc2 SCARLETT JOHANSSON: We`ve worked together before. You know, Josh is -- he`s an incredible writer, director. You know, I loved everything he did at \uc2 Pixar\uc2 . "Toy Story 4." I`ve worked with him on other projects, you know, he`s written stuff for my company, and I`ve been able to collaborate with him, very fortunately, on other things.\par \par \uc2 He has an amazing imagination, and I knew that he was going on to do Transformers because he 