y she is playful and witty and has a talent for climbing.\par \par \uc2 JERICKA DUNCAN: I can`t really tell anybody how big .\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Anybody -- nobody ever realized --\par \par \uc2 JERICKA DUNCAN: . Xin Bao is. Like how?\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: That one went over my head.\par \par \uc2 JERICKA DUNCAN: It is hard to tell just how large they are.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: And this is a big deal, right?\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: But they are so cute. This is a big deal.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: This is a big deal.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: We haven`t been told when these guys will arrive, but these are the first pandas China has loaned to the United States since an agreement between the two countries expired in 2019. Currently, there are only four giant pandas in all of the US, all at the Atlanta Zoo.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: I did not know that.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Yes, so the San Diego Zoo, just let us in on a giant surprise, thanks to a collaboration with China`s Wildlife Conservation Association.\par \par \uc2 Two giant pandas will soon call San Diego home. Again, these are the first pandas loaned to the US since the Smithsonian National Zoo`s were returned last November.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: That was awesome.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Isn`t that awesome?\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: That is awesome.\par \par \uc2 JERICKA DUNCAN: It is.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: Oh love it. Love it. Love it.\par \par \uc2 All right, this is a big story here.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: What have you got?\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: This is a really, really important.\par \par \uc2 AAPI month starts today celebrating the culture and influence of Asian Americans, Native Hawaiians, and Pacific Islanders. Only on CBS MORNINGS, we reveal the Annual Gold House A-100 List recognizing the most impactful Asian Pacific leaders across industries in business and tech.\par \par \uc2 The list includes \