ike 13 days.\par \par \uc2 (End VT)\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: So the 39-year-old says he is making his own timetables and they`ll see where he is in a couple of months.\par \par \uc2 If sticks to that four-month time schedule, that puts him in about middle of January, the season ends January 7th, but then you`ve got the postseason.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Right.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: If the Jets are in the postseason.\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: Aren`t they like one in four? I mean, what are the chances of him coming back and they still have a season to play?\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: Yes. That`s what a lot of people are asking the question, by this time the season will be over, but certain fans that are Jets fans say the season is already --\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: We`re calling --\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: They are in a rough year so far.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Talk about waving the white flag early.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Yes.\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: Recall the acronym Jets "Just Endure The Suffering." J-E- T-S.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: That`s right.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: I like that he is highly motivated.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: I agree.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: He wants to do everything he can to come back and help the team.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: Yes, no doubt.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Yes.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Let`s go with that.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: I like that. And on top of that --\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Setting his own timetable.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: It is tough. Usually guys sit out for like a year.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: That`s right.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: So for him to fight back and want to get back on the field, I admire that.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Yes.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: I do, too. Making his own timetable. I like that.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: No doubt.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Love it. Love it.\p